IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DISTSERVE-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PREFILL-NODES       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DECODE-NODES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 LATENCY-US          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SLO-PCT             PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DISTSERVE-V2.
    IF PREFILL-NODES == 0 OR DECODE-NODES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 450 TO LATENCY-US.
    MOVE 99 TO SLO-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PREFILL-NODES.
    WEIGHT 30 DECODE-NODES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
